{
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "登录入口是 POST /api/auth：以 sso: 前缀走外部 SSO，否则按当前月份查询启用用户、校验口令，并记录登录事件及发送 MQ 通知。",
  "coverage_note": "已检索 web、service、auth、repo、notification 及 mapper 目录；调用索引未发现 AuthService.authenticate 的调用方边，但已通过 Controller 源码确认直接调用关系。SSO 实现类和实际运行时 CredentialChecker 配置未在已读源码中确认。",
  "context": {
    "question": "登录逻辑怎么实现的？调用了什么，被什么调用？读写哪些表？",
    "scope": "检索词 login、登录、password、AuthService、AuthController、authenticate、portal_user、login_event；读取 src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java、service/AuthService.java、repo/UserRepository.java、resources/mapper/UserRepository.xml、auth/SsoAuthPort.java、auth/AuthResult.java、notification/MqLoginNotifier.java 及两个 CredentialChecker 实现。"
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "HTTP 入口为 POST /api/auth，Controller 从请求体读取 username 和 password，调用 AuthService.authenticate，并将 AuthResult 转换为 AuthResponse 返回。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f000bda0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AuthService.authenticate 首先判断 username 非空且以 \"sso:\" 开头；满足时去掉前缀后调用 ssoAuthPort.exchangeToken，并直接返回 SSO 结果，不进入本地用户表查询和本地登录事件记录流程。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "username != null && username.startsWith(\"sso:\")",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:6e1f23b1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本地登录使用当前日期生成 YYYYMM 格式的 month，调用 UserRepository.findActive(month, username) 查询启用用户；查询不到用户时抛出“用户不存在或已停用”。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:38b5d203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本地口令校验是比较数据库返回的 passwordHash 与 credentialChecker.hash(password) 的结果；CredentialChecker 有 LocalCredentialChecker 和 LegacyCredentialChecker 两个实现，实际使用哪个由配置 portal.auth.mode 决定，当前源码无法确认。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:1de59701",
        "sr1:1be62bcb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码不匹配时先写入 BAD_PASSWORD 登录事件，再发送 auth.login.failed MQ 消息，最后抛出“用户名或密码错误”。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "user.passwordHash() 不等于 credentialChecker.hash(password)",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:e2fc2b52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码匹配时写入 SUCCESS 登录事件，发送 auth.login.succeeded MQ 消息，并返回 token-用户ID，且 fromSso=false。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:e2fc2b52",
        "sr1:4073e8e6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本地用户查询 SQL 读取动态物理表 portal_user_${month} 的 id、username、password_hash，条件为 username = #{username} 且 status = 1；实际表名由运行时 month 拼接，源码不能确定唯一月份表名。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:38b5d203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "登录事件 SQL 向动态物理表 portal_login_event_${month} 插入 username、result、created_at，其中 created_at 使用数据库 NOW()；result 为 BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:38b5d203",
        "sr1:0e132f8e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "登录通知通过 LoginNotifier 的 MQ 实现发送，成功和失败分别使用 routing key auth.login.succeeded 与 auth.login.failed；publish 的真实 MQ 连接实现在当前样例源码中不可见。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e2fc2b52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "登录流程未使用本地缓存或会话对象；成功返回的是拼接出的 token-用户ID 字符串。是否由后续组件把该 token 转换为真正会话，当前已读范围未确认。",
      "state": {
        "type": "inferred"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:4073e8e6"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callers": [
    {
      "name": "AuthController.authenticate",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java",
      "detail": "处理 POST /api/auth 请求，并直接调用 authService.authenticate(request.username(), request.password())。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f000bda0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HTTP 客户端",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java",
      "detail": "通过 POST /api/auth 进入 Controller；具体调用方客户端未在当前源码中出现。",
      "kind": "candidate",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f000bda0"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callees": [
    {
      "name": "SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/auth/SsoAuthPort.java",
      "detail": "sso: 前缀分支调用外部 SSO 认证边界。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:6e1f23b1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.findActive",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/repo/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "本地登录分支查询当前月份的启用用户及口令哈希。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:0e132f8e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CredentialChecker.hash",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/auth/CredentialChecker.java",
      "detail": "将原始密码转换为待比较的哈希/摘要；实现可能是 LocalCredentialChecker 或 LegacyCredentialChecker。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:1de59701",
        "sr1:1be62bcb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.insertLoginEvent",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/repo/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "密码错误和密码正确分支都会调用，分别写入 BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:0e132f8e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginNotifier.notifyFailedLogin / notifyLoginSucceeded",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/notification/MqLoginNotifier.java",
      "detail": "失败和成功分支分别发布 MQ 登录事件。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:e2fc2b52"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data_accesses": [
    {
      "object": "portal_user_${month}",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "read"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "仅本地登录分支，即 username 不以 sso: 开头",
        "查询条件为 username = #{username} AND status = 1"
      ],
      "access_method": "UserRepository.findActive -> SELECT id, username, password_hash FROM portal_user_${month}",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:38b5d203",
        "sr1:e813e1eb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "portal_login_event_${month}",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "本地用户存在但密码错误时插入 result=BAD_PASSWORD",
        "本地密码校验成功时插入 result=SUCCESS"
      ],
      "access_method": "UserRepository.insertLoginEvent -> INSERT INTO portal_login_event_${month} (username, result, created_at) VALUES (..., NOW())",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:38b5d203",
        "sr1:e813e1eb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "外部 SSO 认证中心",
      "category": "external",
      "operations": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "username 非空且以 sso: 开头"
      ],
      "access_method": "SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken(username.substring(4), password)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e813e1eb",
        "sr1:6e1f23b1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "MQ",
      "category": "message",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "本地密码错误时发布 auth.login.failed",
        "本地密码正确时发布 auth.login.succeeded"
      ],
      "access_method": "MqLoginNotifier.publish(routingKey, username)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:e2fc2b52"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "title": "接收登录请求",
